# Walkthrough, segment 7: escaping the dimly lit cavern into Xanth (9 points).
#
# SAVE-ANCHORED: Boots and restores the anchor produced by anchor_in_xanth.xit
# (the dimly lit cavern, Nada as Companion). That is NOT the post-opening
# anchor resume_after_opening.xit restores -- a segment-6 save left in slot 1
# is the wrong room, and every click below would land in Mundania.
#
# Route, measured:
# - Wear the 3D glasses in inventory slot 1 (92,162). The context verb is
#   Wear at (14,87): "You slide the way-cool shades on."
# - WAIT is F1 (key 0 59). Three waits, and no fourth: Nada searches the
#   cavern, shifts to the second door, then "it slowly slides open" and the
#   North compass exit lights. A fourth wait starts a different speech.
# - North (24,135). Space advances her greeting to the disbelief question.
#   Option rows on THAT page are lower than the phone/Grundy menus, because
#   the question sits above them. "No. This can't be real." is the yellow
#   row at (100,124).
# - The checkmark at (105,128) pages her explanation; Space extricates Dug.
#   "[9 points] Nada has successfully extricated you from the cavern.
#   You're finally in Xanth." (40 points total.)

include lib/resume_in_xanth.xit
checkpoint wt7_resumed

# --- Wear 3D glasses ---
move 92 162
run 5
click left
run 30
move 14 87
run 5
click left
run 60
move 305 196
run 20
checkpoint wt7_glasses_worn
shot build/frames/wt7_glasses_worn.bmp

# --- Three waits: Nada finds the second door and opens it ---
key 0 59
run 40
key 0 59
run 40
key 0 59
run 40
move 305 196
run 15
checkpoint wt7_door_opened
shot build/frames/wt7_door_opened.bmp

# --- North through the doorway. Space reveals the disbelief question. ---
move 24 135
run 10
click left
run 100
key 32
run 60
move 305 196
run 15
checkpoint wt7_nada_speaks
shot build/frames/wt7_nada_speaks.bmp

# --- "No. This can't be real." ---
move 100 124
run 10
click left
run 60
move 305 196
run 15
checkpoint wt7_option1_chosen
shot build/frames/wt7_option1_chosen.bmp

# --- Page her explanation, then the clearing outside ---
move 105 128
run 10
click left
run 60
key 32
run 60
move 305 196
run 20
checkpoint wt7_cavern_escaped
shot build/frames/wt7_cavern_escaped.bmp
